# Context Map — DonateNow

> Purpose: Defines the dependency graph and reading order for all AI Agent context files.

---

## 1. File Dependency Graph

The arrows (`→`) indicate that a file depends on the context established in the preceding file.

### Primary Flow (The "What" and "Why")
```
business_idea.mdc
       │
       ▼
    PRD.mdc ──────────────┐
       │                  │
       ▼                  ▼
    KPI.mdc           Project_Scope.mdc
       │                  │
       ▼                  ▼
   Personas         Project_Boundaries.mdc
 (iOS, Service, DB)       │
       │                  │
       └─────────┬────────┘
                 ▼
      Detailed_Project_Scope.mdc
```

### Technical Flow (The "How")
```
PRD.mdc + Personas
       │
       ▼
 architecture.mdc
       │
       ├─► ERD.mdc (Database design)
       ├─► security.mdc (Key management, RLS)
       ├─► features.mdc (UI component mapping)
       ├─► style-guide.mdc (SwiftUI tokens)
       ├─► testing.md (XCTest / XCUITest)
       ├─► error_handling.mdc (Swift Errors)
       ├─► deployment.mdc (TestFlight / Edge Functions)
       └─► observability.mdc (OSLog / Instruments)
```

